{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_35","type":"agent_message","text":"The C library is intentionally split: backend symbols live in `libblake.so`, core symbols in `libsphincs_core.so`, and deterministic RNG symbols plus the `DRBG_ctx` global in `libsphincs_core_det.so`. Function exports already match as a union, but true `nm -D` parity also requires the exported data symbols `cst` and `DRBG_ctx`; I’m checking the Rust state layout before adding those real definitions."}}
